user_prompt_template:
UPSTREAM TUTORIAL FRAMING:
{upstream_system_architecture}

PROJECT CONTEXT:
Tutorial Request: {life_event}
Skill Level: {audience}
Output Style: {tone}
Tutorial Type: {formatting_profile}
Depth / Code Preference: {artifact_density}
Context:
{context}

Produce the master tutorial outline. Use one chapter per tutorial module from the upstream framing. Each chapter must include a worksheet/exercise plan with 2-5 concrete artifacts such as implementation checklists, lab tasks, code review prompts, debugging checklists, deployment checklists, or verification rubrics.

Return ONLY the following JSON object. No prose. No markdown. No code fences.

{{
  "document_title": "Full tutorial title that names the build, workflow, or concept",
  "document_subtitle": "A practical walkthrough for [skill level/audience] using [stack/platform if provided]",
  "system_name": "Exact system_name from upstream framing",
  "version": "1.0",
  "total_chapters": 0,
  "master_operating_rules": [
    "[Specific tutorial rule] — Rationale: [why it matters for this build]. Trigger: [when to apply it]. Risk: [what breaks or confuses the learner if ignored]."
  ],
  "cascade_chain": [
    {{
      "source_domain": "Module name from upstream framing",
      "triggers": ["Module name that depends on it"],
      "condition": "When [specific setup/output/checkpoint] is complete, move to [specific next module/action]"
    }}
  ],
  "disclaimer_required": false,
  "introduction_text": "2-3 sentence overview of what the learner will build or understand, who it is for, and how to use the tutorial",
  "chapters": [
    {{
      "chapter_number": 1,
      "domain_id": "domain-01",
      "domain_name": "Must match upstream module name exactly",
      "chapter_title": "Action-oriented lesson title specific to the requested tutorial",
      "chapter_purpose": "One sentence: what the learner accomplishes and verifies in this chapter",
      "key_topics": [
        "Specific command, file, API, component, concept, or decision covered in this module"
      ],
      "common_gap": "Most common mistake or confusion point in this module, including symptom",
      "cascade_triggers": [
        "When [specific checkpoint passes], continue to [specific next module/action]"
      ],
      "worksheet_plan": [
        {{
          "worksheet_id": "ws-01-a",
          "title": "Specific exercise/checklist/rubric title",
          "purpose": "One sentence: what the learner verifies, practices, or records",
          "section_count": 4,
          "estimated_field_count": 12
        }}
      ]
    }}
  ]
}}
